    "name": "Wolfram|Alpha Short Answers API",
    "description": "The Wolfram|Alpha Short Answers API returns a single concise plain-text answer from Wolfram|Alpha. Designed for chatbots, mobile apps, smartwatches, and any context requiring brief factual responses. Returns HTTP 501 when no sufficiently short answer is available.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Wolfram|Alpha Developer Support",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "createdAt": "2026-06-05T15:21:25.000Z",
